              <h4 class="cp-name">3+ Children</h4>
              <p class="cp-blurb">Bigger family, bigger value — every child covered.</p>
              <div class="cp-price">
                <span class="cp-price-amount">$75</span>
                <span class="cp-price-unit">/ month</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="cp-list">
                <li><span class="cp-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>Unlimited open play for every child</li>
                <li><span class="cp-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>Grown-ups always free</li>
                <li><span class="cp-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>Cancel anytime</li>
              </ul>
              {%- assign _v = blank -%}{%- if monthly_prod != blank -%}{%- for v in monthly_prod.variants -%}{%- if v.title contains '3+ Children' -%}{%- assign _v = v -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- if _v == blank -%}{%- assign _v = monthly_prod.variants[2] -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}<a class="cp-cta" href="{%- if _v != blank -%}/cart/{{ _v.id }}:1{%- if m_plan != blank %}?selling_plan={{ m_plan }}{%- endif -%}{%- else -%}/products/monthly-membership{%- endif -%}">Join Monthly</a>
            </article>

          </div>
        </div><!-- /monthly group -->

        <!-- Separator shown only when both groups are visible (no-JS) -->
        <div class="plan-sep" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="plan-sep-line">or go annual &amp; save more</span>
        </div>

        <!-- ---- ANNUAL GROUP ---- -->
        <div class="plan-group" id="group-annual">
          <div class="plan-group-header reveal">
            <span class="group-pill group-pill--annual">Annual — up to 3 months free</span>
            <h3>Commit &amp; save big</h3>
            <p class="muted">Best for families who visit more than once a week. Pay once, play all year, save up to $225.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="cp-grid cp-grid--3">

            <!-- 1 Child Annual -->
            <article class="cp-card reveal" aria-label="1 Child Annual plan">
              <span class="cp-icon cp-icon--sage" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'icon-gift.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="26" height="26"></span>
              <h4 class="cp-name">1 Child</h4>
              <p class="cp-blurb">Save $130 vs paying monthly — about three months free.</p>
              <div class="cp-price">
                <span class="cp-price-amount">$350</span>
                <span class="cp-price-unit">/ year</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="cp-list">
                <li><span class="cp-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>Unlimited open play, all year</li>
                <li><span class="cp-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>Grown-ups always free</li>
                <li><span class="cp-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>Same-day re-entry — come &amp; go all day</li>
              </ul>
              {%- assign _v = blank -%}{%- if annual_prod != blank -%}{%- for v in annual_prod.variants -%}{%- if v.title contains '1 Child' -%}{%- assign _v = v -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- if _v == blank -%}{%- assign _v = annual_prod.variants[0] -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}<a class="cp-cta" href="{%- if _v != blank -%}/cart/{{ _v.id }}:1{%- if a_plan != blank %}?selling_plan={{ a_plan }}{%- endif -%}{%- else -%}/products/annual-membership{%- endif -%}">Join Annual</a>
            </article>

            <!-- 2 Children Annual — MOST POPULAR + FEATURED -->
            <article class="cp-card cp-card--featured reveal" data-delay="1" aria-label="2 Children Annual plan — most popular">
              <span class="cp-popular">Most popular!</span>
              <span class="cp-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'icon-heart.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="26" height="26"></span>
              <h4 class="cp-name">2 Children</h4>
              <p class="cp-blurb">Save $170 vs paying monthly — best value for two siblings.</p>
              <div class="cp-price">
                <span class="cp-price-amount">$550</span>
                <span class="cp-price-unit">/ year</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="cp-list">
                <li><span class="cp-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>Unlimited open play for both kids</li>
                <li><span class="cp-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>Grown-ups always free</li>
                <li><span class="cp-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>Same-day re-entry — come &amp; go all day</li>
              </ul>
              {%- assign _v = blank -%}{%- if annual_prod != blank -%}{%- for v in annual_prod.variants -%}{%- if v.title contains '2 Children' -%}{%- assign _v = v -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- if _v == blank -%}{%- assign _v = annual_prod.variants[1] -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}<a class="cp-cta" href="{%- if _v != blank -%}/cart/{{ _v.id }}:1{%- if a_plan != blank %}?selling_plan={{ a_plan }}{%- endif -%}{%- else -%}/products/annual-membership{%- endif -%}">Join Annual</a>
            </article>

            <!-- 3+ Children Annual -->
            <article class="cp-card reveal" data-delay="2" aria-label="3 or more Children Annual plan">
              <span class="cp-icon cp-icon--coral" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'icon-family.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="26" height="26"></span>
              <h4 class="cp-name">3+ Children</h4>
